    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Dataset для TF-IDF"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "miEx9XV5MuJZ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class TfidfDataset(Dataset):\n",
        "    def __init__(self, X_sparse, y):\n",
        "        self.X = X_sparse\n",
        "        self.y = y\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __len__(self):\n",
        "        return self.X.shape[0]\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __getitem__(self, idx):\n",
        "        x = self.X[idx].toarray().astype(np.float32).squeeze(0)\n",
        "        y = np.int64(self.y[idx])\n",
        "        return torch.tensor(x), torch.tensor(y)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "B5yjN7-kMml6"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Dataset для эмбеддингов"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "V8zSvQkHM6Y8"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class EmbeddingDataset(Dataset):\n",
        "    def __init__(self, X_dense, y):\n",
        "        self.X = X_dense.astype(np.float32)\n",
        "        self.y = y.astype(np.int64)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __len__(self):\n",
        "        return len(self.X)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __getitem__(self, idx):\n",
        "        return torch.tensor(self.X[idx]), torch.tensor(self.y[idx])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dQe8kkaGM0af"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Dataset для последовательностей"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "VpjVF5zzNFct"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class SequenceDataset(Dataset):\n",
        "    def __init__(self, X_seq, y):\n",
        "        self.X = X_seq.astype(np.int64)\n",
        "        self.y = y.astype(np.int64)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __len__(self):\n",
        "        return len(self.X)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __getitem__(self, idx):\n",
        "        return torch.tensor(self.X[idx]), torch.tensor(self.y[idx])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Km7dBTqtNC5C"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "модель TF-IDF + MLP"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9VHEu9VeNJoc"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class TfidfMLP(nn.Module):\n",
        "    def __init__(self, input_dim, hidden_dim=256, dropout=0.3, num_classes=4):\n",
        "        super().__init__()\n",
        "        self.feature_extractor = nn.Sequential(\n",
        "            nn.Linear(input_dim, hidden_dim),\n",
        "            nn.ReLU(),\n",
        "            nn.Dropout(dropout)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        self.classifier = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_classes)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def forward(self, x, return_features=False):\n",
        "        feats = self.feature_extractor(x)\n",
        "        logits = self.classifier(feats)\n",
        "        if return_features:\n",
        "            return logits, feats\n",
        "        return logits"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "egy7_7FGNHYu"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "модель для Sentence-BERT + MLP"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wNqbRWoqNQQq"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class DenseMLP(nn.Module):\n",
        "    def __init__(self, input_dim, hidden_dim=256, dropout=0.3, num_classes=4):\n",
        "        super().__init__()\n",
        "        self.feature_extractor = nn.Sequential(\n",
        "            nn.Linear(input_dim, hidden_dim),\n",
        "            nn.ReLU(),\n",
        "            nn.Dropout(dropout)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        self.classifier = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_classes)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def forward(self, x, return_features=False):\n",
        "        feats = self.feature_extractor(x)\n",
        "        logits = self.classifier(feats)\n",
        "        if return_features:\n",
        "            return logits, feats\n",
        "        return logits"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QQqsv4IzNLlv"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "модель BiLSTM"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "X_MNTuE-NV3u"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "class BiLSTMClassifier(nn.Module):\n",
        "    def __init__(\n",
        "        self,\n",
        "        vocab_size,\n",
        "        embedding_dim=128,\n",
        "        hidden_dim=128,\n",
        "        num_layers=1,\n",
        "        dropout=0.3,\n",
        "        num_classes=4,\n",
        "        pad_idx=0\n",
        "    ):\n",
        "        super().__init__()\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.embedding = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embedding_dim, padding_idx=pad_idx)\n",
        "\n",
        "        lstm_dropout = dropout if num_layers > 1 else 0.0\n",
        "        self.lstm = nn.LSTM(\n",
        "            input_size=embedding_dim,\n",
        "            hidden_size=hidden_dim,\n",
        "            num_layers=num_layers,\n",
        "            batch_first=True,\n",
        "            bidirectional=True,\n",
        "            dropout=lstm_dropout\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\n",
        "        self.classifier = nn.Linear(hidden_dim * 2, num_classes)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def forward(self, x, return_features=False):\n",
        "        emb = self.embedding(x)\n",
        "        output, (h_n, c_n) = self.lstm(emb)\n",
        "\n",
        "        forward_last = h_n[-2]\n",
        "        backward_last = h_n[-1]\n",
        "        feats = torch.cat([forward_last, backward_last], dim=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "        feats = self.dropout(feats)\n",
        "        logits = self.classifier(feats)\n",
        "\n",
        "        if return_features:\n",
        "            return logits, feats\n",
        "        return logits"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ifi3WQaMNSeq"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "функция подсчёта метрик"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "AJnIusQ3Nazp"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def compute_metrics(y_true, y_pred):\n",
        "    return {\n",
        "        \"accuracy\": accuracy_score(y_true, y_pred),\n",
        "        \"macro_f1\": f1_score(y_true, y_pred, average=\"macro\"),\n",
        "        \"macro_precision\": precision_score(y_true, y_pred, average=\"macro\"),\n",
        "        \"macro_recall\": recall_score(y_true, y_pred, average=\"macro\")\n",
        "    }"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "aXOn4T1nNX0n"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "train/eval loop"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "nZoyV-caNe7I"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def train_one_epoch(model, loader, optimizer, criterion, device):\n",
        "    model.train()\n",
        "    total_loss = 0.0\n",
        "    y_true, y_pred = [], []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for X_batch, y_batch in loader:\n",
        "        X_batch = X_batch.to(device)\n",
        "        y_batch = y_batch.to(device)\n",
        "\n",
        "        optimizer.zero_grad()\n",
        "        logits = model(X_batch)\n",
        "        loss = criterion(logits, y_batch)\n",
        "        loss.backward()\n",
        "        optimizer.step()\n",
        "\n",
        "        total_loss += loss.item() * X_batch.size(0)\n",
        "        preds = torch.argmax(logits, dim=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "        y_true.extend(y_batch.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "        y_pred.extend(preds.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "\n",
        "    metrics = compute_metrics(y_true, y_pred)\n",
        "    metrics[\"loss\"] = total_loss / len(loader.dataset)\n",
        "    return metrics\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "@torch.no_grad()\n",
        "def evaluate(model, loader, criterion, device):\n",
        "    model.eval()\n",
        "    total_loss = 0.0\n",
        "    y_true, y_pred = [], []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for X_batch, y_batch in loader:\n",
        "        X_batch = X_batch.to(device)\n",
        "        y_batch = y_batch.to(device)\n",
        "\n",
        "        logits = model(X_batch)\n",
        "        loss = criterion(logits, y_batch)\n",
        "\n",
        "        total_loss += loss.item() * X_batch.size(0)\n",
        "        preds = torch.argmax(logits, dim=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "        y_true.extend(y_batch.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "        y_pred.extend(preds.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "\n",
        "    metrics = compute_metrics(y_true, y_pred)\n",
        "    metrics[\"loss\"] = total_loss / len(loader.dataset)\n",
        "    return metrics"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ERRnyRcFNc1o"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "полноценное обучение модели"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6X5b12-dNltP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def fit_model(\n",
        "    model,\n",
        "    train_loader,\n",
        "    val_loader,\n",
        "    optimizer,\n",
        "    criterion,\n",
        "    device,\n",
        "    num_epochs=10,\n",
        "    patience=3\n",
        "):\n",
        "    history = []\n",
        "    best_val_f1 = -np.inf\n",
        "    best_state = None\n",
        "    best_epoch = 0\n",
        "    no_improve = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "    start_time = time.time()\n",
        "\n",
        "    for epoch in range(1, num_epochs + 1):\n",
        "        train_metrics = train_one_epoch(model, train_loader, optimizer, criterion, device)\n",
        "        val_metrics = evaluate(model, val_loader, criterion, device)\n",
        "\n",
        "        row = {\n",
        "            \"epoch\": epoch,\n",
        "            \"train_loss\": train_metrics[\"loss\"],\n",
        "            \"train_acc\": train_metrics[\"accuracy\"],\n",
        "            \"train_f1\": train_metrics[\"macro_f1\"],\n",
        "            \"val_loss\": val_metrics[\"loss\"],\n",
        "            \"val_acc\": val_metrics[\"accuracy\"],\n",
        "            \"val_f1\": val_metrics[\"macro_f1\"],\n",
        "            \"val_precision\": val_metrics[\"macro_precision\"],\n",
        "            \"val_recall\": val_metrics[\"macro_recall\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "        history.append(row)\n",
        "\n",
        "        print(\n",
        "            f\"Epoch {epoch:02d} | \"\n",
        "            f\"train_loss={row['train_loss']:.4f} | train_f1={row['train_f1']:.4f} | \"\n",
        "            f\"val_loss={row['val_loss']:.4f} | val_f1={row['val_f1']:.4f}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        if row[\"val_f1\"] > best_val_f1:\n",
        "            best_val_f1 = row[\"val_f1\"]\n",
        "            best_state = {k: v.cpu().clone() for k, v in model.state_dict().items()}\n",
        "            best_epoch = epoch\n",
        "            no_improve = 0\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            no_improve += 1\n",
        "\n",
        "        if no_improve >= patience:\n",
        "            print(f\"Early stopping at epoch {epoch}\")\n",
        "            break\n",
        "\n",
        "    total_time = time.time() - start_time\n",
        "\n",
        "    model.load_state_dict(best_state)\n",
        "\n",
        "    history_df = pd.DataFrame(history)\n",
        "    return model, history_df, best_epoch, total_time"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qmYK9kiKNhJR"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "получение предсказаний и скрытых представлений"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qYlUWY-7NuKp"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "@torch.no_grad()\n",
        "def collect_predictions_and_features(model, loader, device):\n",
        "    model.eval()\n",
        "    all_logits = []\n",
        "    all_preds = []\n",
        "    all_targets = []\n",
        "    all_features = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for X_batch, y_batch in loader:\n",
        "        X_batch = X_batch.to(device)\n",
        "        y_batch = y_batch.to(device)\n",
        "\n",
        "        logits, feats = model(X_batch, return_features=True)\n",
        "        preds = torch.argmax(logits, dim=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "        all_logits.append(logits.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "        all_preds.append(preds.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "        all_targets.append(y_batch.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "        all_features.append(feats.cpu().numpy())\n",
        "\n",
        "    return {\n",
        "        \"logits\": np.concatenate(all_logits),\n",
        "        \"preds\": np.concatenate(all_preds),\n",
        "        \"targets\": np.concatenate(all_targets),\n",
        "        \"features\": np.concatenate(all_features)\n",
        "    }"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "rnaYnfymNr0s"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Программная реализация исследования построена таким образом, чтобы обеспечить единообразное обучение, оценку и извлечение скрытых представлений для всех трёх архитектур. Это особенно важно для темы работы, поскольку позволяет анализировать не только итоговые метрики качества, но и внутреннюю организацию текстов в пространстве признаков, формируемом каждой моделью. Тем самым реализация в PyTorch служит не только средством обучения классификаторов, но и инструментом изучения семантических пространств."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "HTIufm78g4sh"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**7. Настройка параметров и обучение моделей**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mVfHnrT3NyZ9"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "конфигурации моделей"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Wp4wR74jN-xZ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Базовые настройки обучения\n",
        "\n",
        "В качестве стартовых конфигураций используются умеренные значения гиперпараметров,\n",
        "обеспечивающие устойчивое обучение в условиях Google Colab.\n",
        "На данном этапе эти настройки выступают как базовые,\n",
        "а в дальнейшем одна из моделей будет дополнительно подвергнута тонкой настройке гиперпараметров."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "sFUw1fUIOCU-"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "dataloaders для TF-IDF"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3IVqnTA0OFVK"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "tfidf_config = {\n",
        "    \"batch_size\": 64,\n",
        "    \"hidden_dim\": 256, # Добавляем скрытое измерение\n",
